msgid "Index file checksums for fast reverse hash lookups and duplicate detection, including REST, CLI and PHP APIs"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Indexes file checksums, so a hash can be looked up in reverse and duplicates found at once.\n"
"\n"
"What you get:\n"
"\n"
"- **Unified Search** by hash: paste a checksum, find the file.\n"
"- A **Checksums** tab in the file details: every algorithm the file carries, recalculated on demand, with its duplicates listed inline.\n"
"- A **Duplicates** page: every group of identical files you hold, and for administrators across every account.\n"
"- **Rules** decide what is hashed and when: instance-wide or per account, by path pattern, computed in the background.\n"
"- A stable **REST API (v1)** and a stable **PHP API** for other apps and integrations.\n"
"- **occ commands** for hashing, searching, duplicates, rules, backup, import and export.\n"
"- Storage in Nextcloud's own files metadata index: no custom tables, nothing to migrate."
msgstr ""

